			"Message": "build(Sky): Configure TypeScript lib and module resolution settings\n\nUpdate `tsconfig.json` and `jsconfig.json` in the Sky editor UI component layer to explicitly define the compilation environment. Add `ESNext`, `DOM`, and `DOM.Iterable` to the `lib` array to ensure proper type checking for modern browser APIs used in the Astro/React frontend. Set `ignoreDeprecations` to \"6.0\" to align with the current TypeScript target. Reorder `extends` to the bottom of `tsconfig.json` to allow local `compilerOptions` like `moduleResolution: \"Bundler\"` and `module: \"esnext\"` to take precedence over the base `@playform/build` configuration.\n\nThis ensures consistent type resolution across the Sky component tree and prevents implicit `any` errors related to missing DOM definitions.",
